DESCRIPTION:Deadline: by the end of Tuesday 7 April 2026\, counted from the
  date you gave for when they received it.\nOne month after they received i
 t (5 March 2026) is 5 April.\nThat is Easter Sunday\, and 6 April is Easte
 r Monday\, so the deadline moves to the next working day.\nIf they extend 
 it\, which they may do only where necessary\, and only if they tell you wi
 thin the first month and give reasons: by the end of Monday 8 June 2026. T
 he law does not say exactly how the extra two months are counted\, so this
  is the later reading.\n\nWhat to do next:\n1. Check whether they have ans
 wered\, or told you within the first month that they need more time.\n2. I
 f not\, you may send a short reminder with your first letter attached.\n3.
  You can complain to the Norwegian Data Protection Authority (Datatilsynet
 ). Keep your letter\, proof of when it reached them and every reply.\n\nMa
